 experiment and see if we cannot, together, create something truly fantastic?'\nYou say, 'How further?'\nTenish says, 'Indeed \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! As you were able to prove that my theory was correct and we were able to harness the power of these ancient artifacts I am now confident enough to attempt the next natural step, to further empower this item! Here is a list of instructions on how we can procede.'\n_The following tasks become available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive)_\nEnchanters\nThought-Attuned Silk Cap\nThought-Attuned Silk Gloves\nThought-Attuned Silk Pants\nThought-Attuned Silk Robe\nThought-Attuned Silk Sandals\nThought-Attuned Silk Sleeves\nThought-Attuned Silk Wristband\nMagicians\nVision-Shrouded Silk Cap\nVision-Shrouded Silk Gloves\nVision-Shrouded Silk Pants\nVision-Shrouded Silk Robe\nVision-Shrouded Silk Sandals\nVision-Shrouded Silk Sleeves\nVision-Shrouded Silk Wristband\nNecromancers\nShadow-Vexed Silk Cap\nShadow-Vexed Silk Gloves\nShadow-Vexed Silk Pants\nShadow-Vexed Silk Robe\nShadow-Vexed Silk Sandals\nShadow-Vexed Silk Sleeves\nShadow-Vexed Silk Wristband\nWizards\nTomekeeper Silk Cap\nTomekeeper Silk Gloves\nTomekeeper Silk Pants\nTomekeeper Silk Robe\nTomekeeper Silk Sandals\nTomekeeper Silk Sleeves\nTomekeeper Silk Wristband\nTenish believes that he can further increase the power of the item you previously created by adding in a powersource, a collector of magical energies. Tenish has been able to confirm that such items have been discovered in both the Vergalid Mines and the Giant City of Valdeholm.\nBring back the item you created and a powersource and deliver it to Tenish so that he can complete the final stage of your experiment.\nQuest Steps:\n1\\. Deliver 1 [Part 1 Armor Piece] to Tenish\n2\\. Deliver 1 A Tranluscent Powersource to Tenish\n_A Tranluscent Powersource drops from various named mobs in Valdeholm and Vergalid Mines._\n_Hand in these two items to receive your upgraded armor, stat bonuses inclued._\n**Submitted by:** Ashwith\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Cap [item=53091]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Gloves [item=53092]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Pants [item=52980]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Robe [item=53093]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Sandals [item=53094]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Sleeves [item=53095]\n- Shadow-Vexed Silk Wristband [item=53096]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Cap [item=53077]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Gloves [item=53078]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Pants [item=53079]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Robe [item=52921]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Sandals [item=53080]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Sleeves [item=53081]\n- Thought-Attuned Silk Wristband [item=53082]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Cap [item=53108]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Gloves [item=53107]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Pants [item=53106]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Robe [item=53105]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Sandals [item=53104]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Sleeves [item=53103]\n- Tomekeeper Silk Wristband [item=53102]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Cap [item=53085]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Gloves [item=53086]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Pants [item=53087]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Robe [item=53088]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Sandals [item=53089]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Sleeves [item=53090]\n- Vision-Shrouded Silk Wristband [item=53084]",
