ten magic just waiting to be discovered and harnessed. I believe I have learned how to tap into some of the most powerful traces of magic lingering in this area and use it to imbue ordinary [armor] items with extraordanary properties!'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nTenish says 'Oh, armor of all types! Anything from Platemail to Silk Robes, I believe I have discovered the secret to creating some of the most powerful protective items ever seen on Norrath. The only hurdle I face is I haven't been able to locate any of the [components] that this tome hints at.'\nYou say, 'What components?'\nTenish says 'Here, I have prepared a list. If you would like to help me search for the items on this list I would be happy to share the resulting items with you. I assure you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, You won't be sorry if you assist me in locating these items!'\n_The following tasks are available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive):_\nBards\nWrought Plate Bracers\nWrought Plate Boots\nWrought Plate Gloves\nWrought Plate Helm\nWrought Plate Vambraces\nWrought Plate Greaves\nWrought Plate Breastplate\nClerics\nFused Plate Bracers\nFused Plate Boots\nFused Plate Gloves\nFused Plate Helm\nFused Plate Vambraces\nFused Plate Greaves\nFused Plate Breastplate\nPaladins\nScribed Plate Bracers\nScribed Plate Boots\nScribed Plate Gloves\nScribed Plate Helm\nScribed Plate Vambraces\nScribed Plate Greaves\nScribed Plate Breastplate\nShadowknights\nHewn Plate Bracers\nHewn Plate Boots\nHewn Plate Gloves\nHewn Plate Helm\nHewn Plate Vambraces\nHewn Plate Greaves\nHewn Plate Breastplate\nWarriors\nMarred Plate Bracers\nMarred Plate Boots\nMarred Plate Gloves\nMarred Plate Helm\nMarred Plate Vambraces\nMarred Plate Greaves\nMarred Plate Breastplate\n_You have been assigned the task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_'._\nTenish believes that he can help you craft new and powerful armors. All you need to do is collect several components and return them to Tenish so he can construct the final item. Tenish believes that you should focus your search far to the North.\nFrom what Tenish can gather there are two types of ancient artifacts that he thinks he can use to construct your new armor items.\nAncient artifacts have become infused with a magical coating that looks strangely like Frost. Search along the path to the Giant city we have heard rumors of for such artifacts.\nThe ash from a distant volcano has fused itself with other artifacts, lending strange properties to them. Search along the path to this volcano for these artifacts.\nThe molds you will need can be found in the same areas as the artifacts although they may be slightly harder to locate. The local denizens of these areas have become aware of the unique properties of these molds and the most powerful among them may be hoarding them for their own purposes.\n_For the Chest Piece:_\n4x Frosted Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Chestplate Mold\n_For the Legs Piece:_\n4x Ash-Covered Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Legplate Mold\n_For the Arms Piece:_\n3x Frosted Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Armplate Mold\n_For the Hands Piece:_\n2x Ash-Covered Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Plate Glove Mold\n_For the Head Piece:_\n3 x Ash-Covered Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Helm Mold\n_For the Boots Piece:_\n2x Frosted Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Plate Boot Mold\n_For the Wrist Piece:_\n1x Ash-Covered Scrap Metal\nAn Ancient Plate Bracer Mold\n_Frosted Scrap Metal drops from mobs in Icefall Glacier and The Steppes._\n_Ash-Covered Scrap Metal drops from mobs in Direwind Cliffs and Sunderock Springs._\n_The molds drop from various 75+ named._\n_Give the required items to Tenash in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task._\nTenish says 'My theory was correct! This is fantastic! Now, friend, I must ask if you are prepared to go [further] with this experiment and see if we cannot, together, create something truly fantastic?'\n_This is the lead-in to another series of tasks, in which you can enhance you armor with stat bonuses._\n**Submitted by:** Laurelina/Menelin, The Silent Minority, Prexus\n- Fused Plate Boots [item=53027]\n- Fused Plate Bracer [item=53028]\n- Fused Plate Breastplate [item=53029]\n- Fused Plate Gauntlets [item=56065]\n- Fused Plate Greaves [item=52552]\n- Fused Plate Helm [item=53030]\n- Fused Plate Vambraces [item=53031]\n- Hewn Plate Boots [item=53044]\n- Hewn Plate Bracer [item=53045]\n- Hewn Plate Breastplate [item=53046]\n- Hewn Plate Gauntlets [item=53047]\n- Hewn Plate Greaves [item=53048]\n- Hewn Plate Helm [item=53049]\n- Hewn Plate Vambraces [item=53050]\n- Marred Plate Boots [item=53054]\n- Marred Plate Bracer [item=56137]\n- Marred Plate Breastplate [item=52551]\n- Marred Plate Gauntlets [item=53055]\n- Marred Plate Greaves [item=53056]\n- Marred Plate Helm [item=53057]\n- Marred Plate Vambraces [item=54714]\n- Scribed Plate Boots [item=53038]\n- Scribed Plate Bracer [item=52923]\n- Scribed Plate Breastplate [item=52172]\n- Scribed Plate Gauntlets [item=53039]\n- Scribed Plate Greaves [item=53040]\n- Scribed Plate Helm [item=56136]\n- Scribed Plate Vambraces [item=54865]\n- Wrought Plate Boots [item=52890]\n- Wrought Plate Bracer [item=54248]\n- Wrought Plate Breastplate [item=52891]\n- Wrought Plate Gauntlets [item=52892]\n- Wrought Plate Greaves [item=52893]\n- Wrought Plate Helm [item=53419]\n- Wrought Plate Vambraces [item=60986]",
