      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crescent Reach [zone=431]\n**Who:**\n- Tenish [ _Quests 71+_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 71\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Armour Set\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ancient Armguard Mold [item=51473]\n- Ancient Chain Boot Mold [item=51475]\n- Ancient Chain Bracer Mold [item=52459]\n- Ancient Chain Glove Mold [item=52461]\n- Ancient Chain Skullcap Mold [item=51476]\n- Ancient Chestguard Mold [item=51493]\n- Ancient Leggings Mold [item=51479]\n- Ash Covered Chain Link [item=51982]\n- Frosted Chain Link [item=51822]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Direwind Cliffs [zone=441]\n- Icefall Glacier [zone=438]\n- Sunderock Springs [zone=435]\n- The Steppes [zone=437]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Berserker\n- Ranger\n- Rogue\n- Shaman\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Sep 22 16:58:40 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is the outline for armor tasks offered by Tenish. They can be completed with a single group. These tasks result in armor with stats in the neighborhood of 215-240hp/mana/end. After completing one of these tasks, you can request a task in which you add stat bonuses to your armor piece. That outline can be found here [quest=3593]._\n_Find Tenesh in Crescent Reach at location -1400, -1440, -55 (up a ramp west of the \"find-able\" Librarian Hemfar)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Tenish'\nTenish says 'Vasha, Friend! Excuse me if I seem distracted but I was just studying this text on ancient and powerful [artifacts] that Librarian Hemfar has compiled.'\nYou say, 'Powerful artifacts?'\nTenish says 'Yes indeed! This entire area is rich with ancient and forgotten magic just waiting to be discovered and harnessed. I believe I have learned how to tap into some of the most powerful traces of magic lingering in this area and use it to imbue ordinary [armor] items with extraordanary properties!'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nTenish says 'Oh, armor of all types! Anything from Platemail to Silk Robes, I believe I have discovered the secret to creating some of the most powerful protective items ever seen on Norrath. The only hurdle I face is I haven't been able to locate any of the [components] that this tome hints at.'\nYou say, 'What components?'\nTenish says 'Here, I have prepared a list. If you would like to help me search for the items on this list I would be happy to share the resulting items with you. I assure you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, You won't be sorry if you assist me in locating these items!'\n_The following tasks are available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive):_\nBerserkers\nScarred Chain Boots\nScarred Chain Coat\nScarred Chain Coif\nScarred Chain Gauntlets\nScarred Chain Leggings\nScarred Chain Sleeves\nScarred Chain Wristguard\nRangers\nEmbraced Chain Boots\nEmbraced Chain Coat\nEmbraced Chain Coif\nEmbraced Chain Gauntlets\nEmbraced Chain Leggings\nEmbraced Chain Sleeves\nEmbraced Chain Wristguard\nRogues\nBladed Chain Boots\nBladed Chain Coat\nBladed Chain Coif\nBladed Chain Gauntlets\nBladed Chain Leggings\nBladed Chain Sleeves\nBladed Chain Wristguard\nShamans\nSeared Chain Boots\nSeared Chain Coat\nSeared Chain Coif\nSeared Chain Gauntlets\nSeared Chain Leggings\nSeared Chain Sleeves\nSeared Chain Wristguard\n_You have been assigned the task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_'._\nTenish believes that he can help you craft new and powerful armors. All you need to do is collect several components and return them to Tenish so he can construct the final item. Tenish believes that you should focus your search far to the North.\nFrom what Tenish can gather there are two types of ancient artifacts that he thinks he can use to construct your new armor items.\nAncient artifacts have become infused with a magical coating that looks strangely like Frost. Search along the path to the Giant city we have heard rumors of for such artifacts.\nThe ash from a distant volcano has fused itself with other artifacts, lending strange properties to them. Search along the path to this volcano for these artifacts.\nThe molds you will need can be found in the same areas as the artifacts although they may be slightly harder to locate. The local denizens of these areas have become aware of the unique properties of these molds and the most powerful among them may be hoarding them for their own purposes.\n_For the Chest Piece:_\n4x Frosted Chain Link\nAn Ancient Chestguard Mold\n_For the Legs Piece:_\n4x Ash Covered Chain Link\nAn Ancient Leggings Mold\n_For the Arms Piece:_\n3x Frosted Chain Link\nAn Ancient Armguard Mold\n_For the Hands Piece:_\n2x Ash Covered Chain Link\nAn Ancient Chain Glove Mold\n_For the Head Piece:_\n3x Ash Covered Chain Link\nAn Ancient Chain Skullcap Mold\n_For the Boots Piece:_\n2x Frosted Chain Link\nAn Ancient Chain Boot Mold\n_For the Wrist Piece:_\n1x Ash Covered Chain Link\nAn Ancient Chain Bracer Mold\n_Frosted Chain Links drop from mobs in Icefall Glacier and The Steppes._\n_Ash Covered Chain Links drop from mobs in Direwind Cliffs and Sunderock Springs._\n_The molds drop from various 75+ named._\n_Give the required items to Tenash in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task._\nTenish says 'My theory was correct! This is fantastic! Now, friend, I must ask if you are prepared to go [further] with this experiment and see if we cannot, together, create something truly fantastic?'\n_This is the lead-in to another series of tasks, in which you can enhance you armor with stat bonuses._\n**Submitted by:** Laurelina/Menelin, The Silent Minority, Prexus\n- Bladed Chain Boots [item=52608]\n- Bladed Chain Coat [item=53000]\n- Bladed Chain Coif [item=67603]\n- Bladed Chain Gauntlets [item=53001]\n- Bladed Chain Leggings [item=53002]\n- Bladed Chain Sleeves [item=53003]\n- Bladed Chain Wristguard [item=55426]\n- Embraced Chain Boots [item=52990]\n- Embraced Chain Coat [item=52992]\n- Embraced Chain Coif [item=52993]\n- Embraced Chain Gauntlets [item=52994]\n- Embraced Chain Leggings [item=52995]\n- Embraced Chain Sleeves [item=52996]\n- Embraced Chain Wristguard [item=52997]\n- Scarred Chain Boots [item=53010]\n- Scarred Chain Coat [item=53011]\n- Scarred Chain Coif [item=55018]\n- Scarred Chain Gauntlets [item=55491]\n- Scarred Chain Leggings [item=53012]\n- Scarred Chain Sleeves [item=55019]\n- Scarred Chain Wristguard [item=67304]\n- Seared Chain Boots [item=52571]\n- Seared Chain Coat [item=52572]\n- Seared Chain Coif [item=52573]\n- Seared Chain Gauntlets [item=52574]\n- Seared Chain Leggings [item=52575]\n- Seared Chain Sleeves [item=53858]\n- Seared Chain Wristguard [item=52576]",
