 receive this prompt:_\nTenish says 'My theory was correct! This is fantastic! Now, friend, I must ask if you are prepared to go [further] with this experiment and see if we cannot, together, create something truly fantastic?'\nYou say, 'How further?'\nTenish says, 'Indeed \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! As you were able to prove that my theory was correct and we were able to harness the power of these ancient artifacts I am now confident enough to attempt the next natural step, to further empower this item! Here is a list of instructions on how we can procede.'\n_The following tasks become available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive)_\nBerserkers\nFire-Scarred Chain Boots\nFire-Scarred Chain Coat\nFire-Scarred Chain Coif\nFire-Scarred Chain Gauntlets\nFire-Scarred Chain Leggings\nFire-Scarred Chain Sleeves\nFire-Scarred Chain Wristguard\nRangers\nVine-Embraced Chain Boots\nVine-Embraced Chain Coat\nVine-Embraced Chain Coif\nVine-Embraced Chain Gauntlets\nVine-Embraced Chain Leggings\nVine-Embraced Chain Sleeves\nVine-Embraced Chain Wristguard\nRogues\nBone-Bladed Chain Boots\nBone-Bladed Chain Coat\nBone-Bladed Chain Coif\nBone-Bladed Chain Gauntlets\nBone-Bladed Chain Leggings\nBone-Bladed Chain Sleeves\nBone-Bladed Chain Wristguard\nShamans\nSpirit-Seared Chain Boots\nSpirit-Seared Chain Coat\nSpirit-Seared Chain Coif\nSpirit-Seared Chain Gauntlets\nSpirit-Seared Chain Leggings\nSpirit-Seared Chain Sleeves\nSpirit-Seared Chain Wristguard\nTenish believes that he can further increase the power of the item you previously created by adding in a powersource, a collector of magical energies. Tenish has been able to confirm that such items have been discovered in both the Vergalid Mines and the Giant City of Valdeholm.\nBring back the item you created and a powersource and deliver it to Tenish so that he can complete the final stage of your experiment.\nQuest Steps:\n1\\. Deliver 1 [Part 1 Armor Piece] to Tenish\n2\\. Deliver 1 A Faintly Powersource to Tenish\n_A Faintly Powersource drops from various named mobs in Valdeholm and Vergalid Mines._\n_Hand in these two items to receive your upgraded armor, stat bonuses inclued._\n**Submitted by:** Ashwith\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Boots [item=52607]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Coat [item=53004]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Coif [item=53005]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Gauntlets [item=53006]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Leggings [item=53007]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Sleeves [item=53008]\n- Bone-Bladed Chain Wristguard [item=53009]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Boots [item=53013]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Coat [item=53014]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Coif [item=53015]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Gauntlets [item=53016]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Leggings [item=53017]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Sleeves [item=53018]\n- Fire-Scarred Chain Wristguard [item=53019]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Boots [item=52912]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Coat [item=52913]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Coif [item=54245]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Gauntlets [item=52914]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Leggings [item=52915]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Sleeves [item=52916]\n- Spirit-Seared Chain Wristguard [item=54246]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Boots [item=52991]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Coat [item=52998]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Coif [item=54117]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Gauntlets [item=55058]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Leggings [item=52999]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Sleeves [item=53200]\n- Vine-Embraced Chain Wristguard [item=53527]",
