gic just waiting to be discovered and harnessed. I believe I have learned how to tap into some of the most powerful traces of magic lingering in this area and use it to imbue ordinary [armor] items with extraordanary properties!'\nYou say, 'What armor?'\nTenish says 'Oh, armor of all types! Anything from Platemail to Silk Robes, I believe I have discovered the secret to creating some of the most powerful protective items ever seen on Norrath. The only hurdle I face is I haven't been able to locate any of the [components] that this tome hints at.'\nYou say, 'What components?'\nTenish says 'Here, I have prepared a list. If you would like to help me search for the items on this list I would be happy to share the resulting items with you. I assure you, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, You won't be sorry if you assist me in locating these items!'\nThe following tasks are available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive):\nBeastlords\nEmblazoned Leather Armwraps\nEmblazoned Leather Boots\nEmblazoned Leather Cowl\nEmblazoned Leather Gloves\nEmblazoned Leather Leggings\nEmblazoned Leather Tunic\nEmblazoned Leather Wristband\nDruids\nInlaid Leather Armwraps\nInlaid Leather Boots\nInlaid Leather Cowl\nInlaid Leather Gloves\nInlaid Leather Leggings\nInlaid Leather Tunic\nInlaid Leather Wristband\nMonks\nBlessed Leather Armwraps\nBlessed Leather Boots\nBlessed Leather Cowl\nBlessed Leather Gloves\nBlessed Leather Leggings\nBlessed Leather Tunic\nBlessed Leather Wristband\nYou have been assigned the task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_'.\nTenish believes that he can help you craft new and powerful armors. All you need to do is collect several components and return them to Tenish so he can construct the final item. Tenish believes that you should focus your search far to the North.\nFrom what Tenish can gather there are two types of ancient artifacts that he thinks he can use to construct your new armor items.\nAncient artifacts have become infused with a magical coating that looks strangely like Frost. Search along the path to the Giant city we have heard rumors of for such artifacts.\nThe ash from a distant volcano has fused itself with other artifacts, lending strange properties to them. Search along the path to this volcano for these artifacts.\nThe molds you will need can be found in the same areas as the artifacts although they may be slightly harder to locate. The local denizens of these areas have become aware of the unique properties of these molds and the most powerful among them may be hoarding them for their own purposes.\nFor the Chest Piece:\n4x Frosted Hide\nAn Ancient Chestwrap Pattern\nFor the Legs Piece:\n4x Ash-Covered Hide\nAn Ancient Legwrap Pattern\nFor the Arms Piece:\n3 x Frosted Hide\nAn Ancient Armwrap Pattern\nFor the Hands Piece:\n2x Ash-Covered Hide\nAn Ancient Leather Glove Pattern\nFor the Head Piece:\n3x Ash-Covered Hide\nAn Ancient Leather Skullcap Pattern\nFor the Boots Piece:\n2x Frosted Hide\nAn Ancient Leather Boot Pattern\nFor the Wrist Piece:\n1x Ash-Covered Hide\nAn Ancient Leather Bracer Pattern\nFrosted Hide drops from mobs in Icefall Glacier and The Steppes. Ash-Covered Hide drops from mobs in Direwind Cliffs and Sunderock Springs. The molds drop from various 75+ named.\nGive the required items to Tenash in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task.\nTenish says 'My theory was correct! This is fantastic! Now, friend, I must ask if you are prepared to go [further] with this experiment and see if we cannot, together, create something truly fantastic?'\nThis is the lead-in to another series of tasks, in which you can enhance you armor with stat bonuses.\n- Blessed Leather Armwraps [item=53123]\n- Blessed Leather Boots [item=53124]\n- Blessed Leather Cowl [item=53125]\n- Blessed Leather Gloves [item=53126]\n- Blessed Leather Leggings [item=53127]\n- Blessed Leather Tunic [item=52875]\n- Blessed Leather Wristguard [item=53128]\n- Emblazoned Leather Armwraps [item=53110]\n- Emblazoned Leather Boots [item=53733]\n- Emblazoned Leather Cowl [item=53111]\n- Emblazoned Leather Gloves [item=53112]\n- Emblazoned Leather Leggings [item=53734]\n- Emblazoned Leather Tunic [item=53113]\n- Emblazoned Leather Wristguard [item=53735]\n- Inlaid Leather Armwraps [item=53732]\n- Inlaid Leather Boots [item=53114]\n- Inlaid Leather Cowl [item=55008]\n- Inlaid Leather Gloves [item=55483]\n- Inlaid Leather Leggings [item=53115]\n- Inlaid Leather Tunic [item=53116]\n- Inlaid Leather Wristguard [item=53117]",
