lates drop from random mobs in Blightfire Moors._\n_The patterns drop from various named mobs in Blightfire Moors._\n_Give the required items to Kimem in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task._\n- Blessed Plate Boots [item=53426]\n- Blessed Plate Bracer [item=53427]\n- Blessed Plate Breastplate [item=53428]\n- Blessed Plate Gauntlets [item=53429]\n- Blessed Plate Greaves [item=53430]\n- Blessed Plate Helm [item=53431]\n- Blessed Plate Vambraces [item=53432]\n- Dredged Plate Boots [item=53433]\n- Dredged Plate Bracer [item=53434]\n- Dredged Plate Breastplate [item=53436]\n- Dredged Plate Gauntlets [item=53437]\n- Dredged Plate Greaves [item=53438]\n- Dredged Plate Helm [item=53439]\n- Dredged Plate Vambraces [item=53440]\n- Forged Plate Boots [item=53441]\n- Forged Plate Bracer [item=53442]\n- Forged Plate Breastplate [item=53443]\n- Forged Plate Gauntlets [item=53444]\n- Forged Plate Greaves [item=53445]\n- Forged Plate Helm [item=53446]\n- Forged Plate Vambraces [item=53447]\n- Sanctified Plate Boots [item=53376]\n- Sanctified Plate Bracer [item=53377]\n- Sanctified Plate Breastplate [item=53378]\n- Sanctified Plate Gauntlets [item=53379]\n- Sanctified Plate Greaves [item=53380]\n- Sanctified Plate Helm [item=53381]\n- Sanctified Plate Vambraces [item=53382]\n- Toned Plate Boots [item=53383]\n- Toned Plate Bracer [item=55257]\n- Toned Plate Breastplate [item=53384]\n- Toned Plate Gauntlets [item=53448]\n- Toned Plate Greaves [item=53385]\n- Toned Plate Helm [item=53386]\n- Toned Plate Vambraces [item=53387]",
