      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crescent Reach [zone=431]\n**Who:**\n- Guard Captain Minka [npc=22748]\nRating:\n0/2**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(Average from 2 ratings)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 1\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | Yes\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n**Quest Items:**\n- Wild Crescent Rose [item=52187]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Jeweler Kamilah [npc=22749]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Love in the Air #2: Kamilah's Delight [quest=3655]\n- Love in the Air #3: Nexeu's Gift [quest=3656]\n- Love in the Air #4: Charmed, I'm Sure [quest=3657]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Oct 2 18:17:24 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This task is the first in a series of four. Completing the series opens the quest paths of three NPCs: Vunder the Dark, Akins, and Council Aide Shay._\n_Find Guard Captain Minka, located in the back section of Scaleguard Barracks on the second level._\nYou say, 'Hail, Guard Captain Minka'\nGuard Captain Minka says 'Alas, my mood is melancholy friend. Speak your business so I may continue to [wallow].'\nYou say, 'Wallow?'\nGuard Captain Minka says 'Tis a long story, but I suppose airing my quandary might aid me. My heart has been besieged by a beautiful drakkin. Her name is Kamilah and the image of her in my mind drives me to great distraction. I'm meant to be the guard captain of this great city and I find I'm getting distracted. And while I would cut down any enemy without any hesitation I can't find the courage to tell her how I feel! Hm, you seem fairly brazen, perhaps you might [help] me.'\nYou say, 'I will help you'\n_You have been assigned the task 'Love in the Air: Guard's Fancy'._\nGuard Captain Minka says 'Kamilah is a jeweler in Artisan's Row on the second level of Crescent Reach. You will no doubt recognize her beauty very easily. I've been saving this gift for her until I had the courage to hand it to her. Take this to her and tell her it is from me! Oh how my spirits have been lifted!'\n_Receive Wild Crescent Rose, and take it to Jeweler Kamilah in The Jeweled Serpent in Artisan's Row on the second level. Doing the hand-in completes the task._\n_Your task 'Love in the Air: Guard's Fancy' has been updated._\nSadly, Kamilah cannot return affection to Guard Captain Minkah, but she does have a sparkle in her eye when she talks about Herald Nexeu.\nYou gain experience!!\nJeweler Kamilah says 'Oh, a gift?' Kamilah reads the card and the sparkle in her eye is extinguished and she starts to sneeze. 'Get this potpourri away from me! I'm allergic to those dried flowers! It figures. I've seen that guard on his patrol constantly eyeing me. More like leering. It makes my stomach turn. Now he's either trying to buy me or kill me? Why must the wrong [drakkin] always court me?'\n_This is the lead-in to the next task in the series._\n**Submitted by:** Vatglut of Drinal",
    },
