ning, my life's journey, and so took to exploring even though I was just awoken from what I call the human-dream. That is the life I don't remember, but I imagine I was a plainswalker then.'\nYou say, 'Wanderlust?'\nMaster Vanguard Regan says 'I started this guild so that those like me who yearn to seek knowledge of the world are among those of like kind. We travel to unknown places and learn about them. We collect and share all our information and I have a journeystone for members that continue to support the guild. It will even grow more powerful the more you aid us. Would you like to [join]?'\nYou say, 'I would like to join.'\nMaster Vanguard Regan says 'Very good! To be a member, all that is required is that you investigate and explore. I will almost always have places in the world I would like you to see. For now, I would like you to explore some areas of Blightfire Moors. Will you [do this] for me?'\nYou say, 'I will do this.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Wanderlust Guild: On Guard'.\nThe first exploration quest Master Vanguard Regan would like you to take on requires you to explore the Blightfore Moors. First, you will need to locate the Guard Outpost. Second, search for a dark tower in the Northern region of the area. You will also need to locate the Slashclaw Cliffs to the southern end of that territory. Good luck.\n_Head to Blightfire Moors._\nLocate the Crossroads - Blightfire Moors\n_-115, +575, near the middle of the zone with the quest NPCs._\nYour task 'Wanderlust Guild: On Guard' has been updated.\nLocate the Dark Tower - Blightfire Moors\n_+1500, +2990, in the northwest corner of the zone near the undead._\nYour task 'Wanderlust Guild: On Guard' has been updated.\nExplore the Slashclaw Cliffs - Blightfire Moors\n_-2050, +1115, in the south end of the zone._\nYour task 'Wanderlust Guild: On Guard' has been updated.\nReturn to Crescent Reach. - Crescent Reach\nYou say, 'Hail, Master Vanguard Regan'\nYour task 'Wanderlust Guild: On Guard' has been updated.\nRegan is impressed at how quickly you found these dangerous areas and that you are still alive. He will have much more for you to do if you are strong enough.\nYou receive 5 platinum .\nYou gain experience!!\nYou have successfully been granted your reward for: Wanderlust Guild: On Guard\n**Submitted by:** Argonot Kindheart, Alarius, Cazic Thule\n- Wanderlust Guild Loadstone [item=52451]",
