      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Crescent Reach [zone=431]\n**Who:**\n- Terraxs [npc=22946]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Armour Set\n**Quest Items:**\n- Power Infused Hide [item=53321]\n- Timeworn Armguard Mold [item=52774]\n- Timeworn Boot Mold [item=53317]\n- Timeworn Bracer Mold [item=52775]\n- Timeworn Chestguard Mold [item=54646]\n- Timeworn Glove Mold [item=53318]\n- Timeworn Leggings Mold [item=54647]\n- Timeworn Skullcap Mold [item=53319]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Terraxs's Leather Armor (Part 2) [quest=3777]\n**Era:** | !Serpents Spine\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- Beastlord\n- Druid\n- Monk\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 26 15:02:18 2006\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This is the outline for armor tasks offered by Terraxs. You will not be able to complete these tasks without an upper-end raiding guild. These tasks result in armor with stats in the neighborhood of 450-475hp/mana/end. After completing one of these tasks, you can request a task in which you add stat bonuses to your armor piece. That outline can be found here [quest=3777]._\n_Find Terraxs on the second floor of Crescent Reach at location -1395, -1920. He is located next to the alchemy vendors._\nYou say, 'Hail, Terraxs'\nTerraxs says 'Vasha, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_. Have you come to me because you hunger for a [challenge]?'\nYou say, 'I hunger for a challenge'\nTerraxs says 'Indeed! I have learned the secret of forming together armors of amazing power but only the strongest and most valiant should attempt to walk the [road] I can lead you down!'\nYou say, 'A road...'\nTerraxs says 'Well not an actual road, no, of course not! I meant it more figuratively! I have discovered the forms of a [recipe] that I think may wish to explore with me, \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!'\nYou say, 'What recipe is that?'\nTerraxs says 'I have compared notes with my friend Tenish about the magical relics we have been coming across. We both have a theory about how to leverage the power lying dormant in these items but Tenish thinks too small for my taste. I have heard that the really powerful relics are closer to the [source] of the magic that has enchanted the relics we have found.'\nYou say, 'What magic source?'\nTerraxs says 'I suppose I should say sources, not source. The peak our cousin Dyn`leth sits atop and the mighty giant enclave both appear to be focal points for incredible energy. If you would like to experiment with me, and if you and your companions are strong enough, then I can share with you my [thoughts] on the subject'\nYou say, 'Please, share your thoughts'\nTerraxs says 'Excellent \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_! Return to me when you have gathered these items and we will attempt to craft something fantastic together!'\n_The following tasks are available, depending on your class (the name of the task is the piece of armor you will receive):_\n_You have been assigned the task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_'._\n_Beastlords:_\nWildcry Armwraps\nWildcry Boots\nWildcry Cowl\nWildcry Gloves\nWildcry Leggings\nWildcry Tunic\nWildcry Wristband\n_Druids:_\nPurevine Armwraps\nPurevine Boots\nPurevine Cowl\nPurevine Gloves\nPurevine Leggings\nPurevine Tunic\nPurevine Wristband\n_Monks:_\nWhisperwind Armwraps\nWhisperwind Boots\nWhisperwind Cowl\nWhisperwind Gloves\nWhisperwind Leggings\nWhisperwind Tunic\nWhisperwind Wristband\nTerraxs believes that he can help you craft new and powerful armors. All you need to do is collect several components and return them to Terraxs so he can construct the final item. Terraxs believes that you should focus your search far to the North.\nFrom what Terraxs can gather there are two types of ancient artifacts that he thinks he can use to construct new armor items.\nAncient artifacts have become infused with a magical coating that looks strangely like Frost. Search along the path to the Giant city we have heard rumors of for such artifacts.\nThe ash from a distant volcano has fused itself with ancient artifacts, lending strange properties to them. Search along the path to this volcano for these artifacts.\nThe molds you will need can be found in the same areas as the artifacts although they may be much harder to locate. The local denziens of these areas have become aware of the unique properties of these molds and the most powerful among them are hoarding them for their own purposes. From what Terraxs can gather you may need to face the master of each area to find the molds you seek!\n_For the Chest Piece:_\n_4x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Chestguard Mold_\n_For the Legs Piece:_\n_4x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Leggings Mold_\n_For the Arms Piece:_\n_3x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Armguard Mold_\n_For the Hands Piece:_\n_2x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Glove Mold_\n_For the Head Piece:_\n_3x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Skullcap Mold_\n_For the Boots Piece:_\n_2x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Boot Mold_\n_For the Wrist Piece:_\n_1x Power Infused Hide_\n_1x A Timeworn Bracer Mold_\n_Power Infused Hides drop from random trash mobs in Ashengate and Froscrypt raid instances while Timeworn Molds drop from various high-end raid encounters in the same instances._\n_Give the required items to Terraxs in exchange for your armor piece and completion of the task._\n_Your task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_' has been updated._\n_Your task '\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_' has been updated._\n_In yellow text:_\n_Well done! I'm impressed at what you accomplished in gathering together the supplies for this item!_\n_You have been given: \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\__\n_This is the lead-in to another series of tasks, in which you can enhance you armor with stat bonuses._\n- Purevine Armwraps [item=54676]\n- Purevine Boots [item=54677]\n- Purevine Cowl [item=54678]\n- Purevine Gloves [item=54679]\n- Purevine Leggings [item=54680]\n- Purevine Tunic [item=54681]\n- Purevine Wristguard [item=54682]\n- Whisperwind Armwraps [item=53957]\n- Whisperwind Boots [item=53399]\n- Whisperwind Cowl [item=53401]\n- Whisperwind Gloves [item=55505]\n- Whisperwind Leggings [item=55480]\n- Whisperwind Tunic [item=53961]\n- Whisperwind Wristguard [item=53397]\n- Wildcry Armwraps [item=55573]\n- Wildcry Boots [item=54798]\n- Wildcry Cowl [item=53567]\n- Wildcry Gloves [item=55022]\n- Wildcry Leggings [item=54799]\n- Wildcry Tunic [item=55161]\n- Wildcry Wristguard [item=54800]",
