ind \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_' has been updated.\nYour task 'Osh`viir`s Whisperwind \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_' has been updated.\nin Yellow text:\nYou have created an incredibly powerful item!\nYou have been given: Osh`vir`s Whisperwind \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n_Large Flickering Powersources drop from various named mobs in Ashengate and Frostcrypt._\n_Hand in these two items to receive your upgraded armor, stat bonuses inclued._\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Armwraps [item=55509]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Boots [item=53400]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Cowl [item=53402]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Gloves [item=55507]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Leggings [item=55482]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Tunic [item=53960]\n- Osh`vir`s Whisperwind Wristguard [item=53398]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Armwraps [item=54683]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Boots [item=54684]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Cowl [item=54685]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Gloves [item=54686]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Leggings [item=54687]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Tunic [item=54688]\n- Venesh`s Purevine Wristguard [item=54689]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Armwraps [item=54801]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Boots [item=54802]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Cowl [item=53568]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Gloves [item=55023]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Leggings [item=54803]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Tunic [item=55283]\n- Venesh`s Wildcry Wristguard [item=54804]",
